<title>POLAND: Polish LOT airline 1996 loss PLN 45.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Polish LOT airline 1996 loss PLN 45.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish state airlines PLL LOT recorded a 45.9 million zloty net loss in 1996 compared with a 5.5 million zloty net profit in 1995, the company's president said on Friday.</p>
</text>
